            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n  \"quote\": \"Except as otherwise provided herein, a Party shall not have the right to assign any of its rights or obligations under this Agreement (whether through a merger, sale of stock, or otherwise) without the prior written consent of the other Party\",\n  \"overrideQuote\": \"Notwithstanding any provision of this Agreement granting a right of termination or requiring consent upon a change of control, no such right or consent requirement shall arise where the surviving or acquiring entity was an Affiliate of the transferring party immediately prior to the transaction, or where the transaction is effected solely to change the jurisdiction of incorporation of the transferring party.\",\n  \"note\": \"Section 10.2 restricts assignment or transfer via merger or sale of stock without prior written consent, but a specific Change of Control Exception carves out transactions involving pre-existing Affiliates or reincorporations.\"\n}\n```",
